vendor/gpui-pre-apple is gpui-pre-apple 0.3.9 from crates.io (Zed Industries,
Apache-2.0). Three focused modifications follow the fixes demonstrated by
Monocode at b200f566 (https://github.com/hardbeat920/monocode): round CoreText
font weights for CSS face matching, use source-over destination alpha for both
Metal pipelines, and clip outer shadows outside their element. No Monocode
application code is included. The remainder is the upstream registry source.

vendor/gpui-pre-macos is gpui-pre-macos 0.3.9 from crates.io (Zed Industries,
Apache-2.0). The preview retains the native UnderWindowBackground material
instead of stripping its tint and saturation, matching Inferay desktop-host.

